\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Task Item</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80 - 100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20080115060508&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_of_Demonic_Blood_870e63.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a flask of demonic blood.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.90 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Shake it to create a potion.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It turns into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> and the Blood Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blood Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Effect_513203.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> appears when you <i>shake it</i> by using it.<br/>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a>.<br/><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Concentrated Demonic Blood/Statistics </i> </span>250 are needed for the achievement Demonic Barkeeper and 1 is needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>It used to be called <i>Concentrated Demonic Blood</i> until it was renamed to <i>Flask of Demonic Blood</i> in February 09, 2021, for unknown reasons.\n</p><p>On November 09, 2021 the flask weight has changed from 2.00 oz to 2.90 oz.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Book\">Burning Book</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfire%20Asura\">Dawnfire Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Diabolic%20Imp\">Diabolic Imp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Knight\">Falcon Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Floating%20Savant\">Floating Savant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Flower%20Asura\">Frost Flower Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fury\">Fury</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Furyosa\">Furyosa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Chaplain%20Gaunder\">Grand Chaplain Gaunder</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grimeleech\">Grimeleech</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hand%20of%20Cursed%20Fate\">Hand of Cursed Fate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellflayer\">Hellflayer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhound\">Hellhound</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Juggernaut\">Juggernaut</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#